desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "javascript"
	title: "Struct scan: JavaScript lodash merge"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：JavaScript lodash merge"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-js-lodash-merge"
	risk: "input-validation"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 lodash merge。未过滤 __proto__ 可导致原型污染。

### 风险类型
input-validation

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 Object.create(null) 或不合并不可信对象。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://a.js": <<<POS
const _ = require("lodash");
function m(a, b) { return _.merge(a, b); }

POS
	"safefile://s.js": <<<NEG
function m(a, b) { return Object.assign({}, a, b); }

NEG
)

_.merge(* as $a) as $call
lodash.merge(* as $a) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: JavaScript lodash merge",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：JavaScript lodash merge",
	message: "结构扫描：JavaScript lodash merge",
	risk: "input-validation",
}
